# Static-host rules. The app uses a HASH router (#/search, #/e?id=…), so unknown
# paths never reach the server in normal use — the catch-all is a safety net for a
# stray link or a hand-typed path, not a requirement.
#
# The /cdn rule matters more: it keeps the baked snapshot served as real files
# instead of being swallowed by the catch-all.
/cdn/*  /cdn/:splat  200
/*      /index.html  200
